Recommends: lsscsi, nfs-common
Description: Dell EMC Storage Plugins for Proxmox VE
 This package provides Proxmox VE custom storage plugins for Dell EMC
 storage arrays. Each product family is registered as its own PVE storage
 type; they share a common host-side layer for iSCSI/FC login, SCSI device
 lifecycle and dm-multipath handling.
 .
 Storage types provided:
  - dellpowerstore  Dell PowerStore over iSCSI or Fibre Channel
 .
 Features:
  - Direct volume provisioning (one VM disk = one array volume)
  - Snapshot create/list/delete/rollback
  - Thin clone based linked clones and templates
  - Multipath I/O with orphan device reaping
  - Cluster-aware mapping for live migration
 .
 The plugin must be installed on every node of the cluster.
